ter` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\nFixes #45523 #103951 #91600\r\n\r\nUses libjpeg from [the Independent JPEG Group](https://www.ijg.org/), which is pretty much the reference implementation. Might have been nice to use libjpeg-turbo instead for the speed improvements but it seemed too complicated to shoe-horn into Godot's scons system.\r\n\r\nDoesn't appear to be any impact on speed or binary size as a result of the changes, but the images from those linked issues load correctly now.\r\n\r\n- [ ] implement saving (compression)\r\n- [ ] test on different platforms\r\n- [ ] add more error handling\r\n- [ ] replace the jpg module entirely and migrate thorvg and basis_universal to use this module?\r\n\r\nBefore I start on those I thought I'd see what you all think of the approach?","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-03-18T05:19:55Z","updated_at":"2025-03-20T21:47:35Z","closed_at":"2025-03-20T21:31:09Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"52e2cfd016ee6de69f492c1